    "answer": {
      "short": "$108$",
      "worked": "Multiples of $18$ are $18,36,\\ldots$. The first divisible by $12$ is $36$.\n\n$\\operatorname{LCM}(12,18)=36$\n\nMultiples of $36$ are $36,72,108,144,\\ldots$. The only one between $100$ and $120$ is $108$.",
